{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04081","headline":"奉和圣制途次旧居应制 · 苏頲","name":"奉和圣制途次旧居应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潞国临淄邸，天王别驾舆。\n出潜离隐际，小往大来初。\n东陆行春典，南阳即旧居。\n约川星罕驻，扶道日旗舒。\n云覆连行在，风廻助扫除。\n木行城邑望，臯落土田疏。\n昔试邦兴后，今过俗徯予。\n示威宁校猎，崇让不陈鱼。\n府吏趋宸扆，乡耆捧帝车。\n帐倾三饮处，闲整六飞余。\n盛业铭汾鼎，昌期应洛书。\n愿陪歌赋末，留比蜀相如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04081.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04081","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}